000900*
001000**************************************************************
001100*                                                            *
001200*   T I N V B A C K                                          *
001300*                                                            *
001400*   THIS SUB PROGRAM BACKS OUT AN INVOICE WHEN IT IS         *
001500*   EITHER PLACED ON HOLD OR DELETED.  THE FOLLOWING         *
001600*   FUNCTIONS ARE PERFORMED:                                 *
001700*       1) QUANTITY PAID FOR ALL ITEMS IS BACKED OUT IN THE  *
001800*          PO ITEM SEGMENTS.                                 *
001900*       2) COLLECT FREIGHT BILLS REMOVED FROM THE REGISTER   *
002000*          LINK.                                             *
002100*       3) ZBILL INFORMATION IS REMOVED FROM INVOICE         *
002200*       4) PAYMENT INDICATOR IS SPACED OUT                   *
002300*       5) ALL CALCULATIONS ARE SET BACK TO ZERO             *
002400*  ONCE THESE FUNCTIONS ARE DONE THE USER MUST RUN THE       *
002500*  INVOICE CREATE PGM AND USE THE RESTART OPTION TO TAKE AN  *
002600*  INVOICE OUT OF THE HOLD STATUS.                           *
002700*                                                            *
002800**************************************************************
002900*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S           *
003000*         C A L L E D    B Y :                               *
003100*      1. TINVHOLD.SOURCE - PUT INVOICE ON HOLD              *
003200*      2. TINVDELT.SOURCE - DELETE AN INVOICE                *
003300**************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *C*  07/12/1996    CA YODER                                  *
      *C*    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.      *
      **************************************************************
003500
003600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
003900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DPOITEM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
004000
           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
004000
           SELECT DPOFREIGHT-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2404
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
004000
           SELECT DINVITM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
004100 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
