       FD  MSTORERM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.
       FD  DPOFREIGHT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOFREIGHT-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS2404.
       FD  DINVITM-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DINVITM-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS2601.
