014700 BACKOUT-INVOICE SECTION 04.
014800     PERFORM  6-OPEN-FILES.
014900     PERFORM  6-BACK-OUT-INVOICE  THRU  6-BACK-OUT-INVOICE-X.
           PERFORM  6-CLOSE-FILES.
015000     GOBACK.
015100
015200 2-BLOWUP.
015300     MOVE "TINVBACK"    TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
015400     MOVE REGISTER-ARG  TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
015500     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
015600         DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
015700                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
015800
015900 2-BLOWUP-X.
016000     EXIT.
016100
       6-OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT MSTORERM-I.
           OPEN I-O   DPOFREIGHT-O,
                      DINVITM-O,
                      DPOITEM-O.
016200
       6-CLOSE-FILES.
           CLOSE MSTORERM-I, DPOFREIGHT-O, DINVITM-O,
                 DPOITEM-O.

016300 6-BACK-OUT-INVOICE.
